%% TradeTick — one stream, two consumers: a tick strategy (OnTradeTick) and an alt-bar (OnBarComplete)
sequenceDiagram
    participant V as Binance aggTrade WS
    participant VC as BinanceVenueConnector
    participant P as RelayIngest.Pump
    participant RW as RelayWriter (archival)
    participant TR as TickRouter
    participant S as TickAggregationBarSource (EqV)
    participant D as StrategyDispatch
    participant Q as session MarketDataQueue
    participant ST as Strategy (ITradeTickStrategy + bar)

    V->>VC: aggTrade
    VC->>P: TradeEvent(TradeTick)
    P->>RW: WriteTrade (lossless, FIRST)
    P->>TR: tap.OnTrade → Publish(instrument, tick)
    TR->>D: DispatchTick(instrument, tick)
    D->>Q: enqueue ()=>OnTradeTick(tick, sub)
    TR->>S: Feed(in tick)
    Note over S: TickToSourceRecord → IBarAccumulator.TryAdvance
    alt threshold crossed (bar closes)
        S-->>TR: onBar(bar, isStart:false)
        TR->>D: DispatchBar(instrument, EqV-spec, bar, false)
        D->>Q: enqueue ()=>OnBarComplete(bar, sub)
    end
    Q->>ST: OnTradeTick(tick, sub)
    Q->>ST: OnBarComplete(bar, sub)
    ST->>ST: decide → submit order (per callback)
